
flowchart LR

subgraph PRESENTATION
UI[UI: User taps Login]
Event[Bloc Event: LoginEvent]
Bloc[Bloc: Handles Event & Emits State]
end

subgraph DOMAIN
UseCase[UseCase: LoginUseCase]
RepoInterface[Repository Interface: AuthRepository]
Entity[Entity: User]
end

subgraph DATA
RepoImpl[Repository Implementation]
DataSource[Remote Data Source]
API[API Server]
Model[Model converts JSON to Entity]
end

UI --> Event
Event --> Bloc
Bloc --> UseCase
UseCase --> RepoInterface
RepoInterface --> RepoImpl
RepoImpl --> DataSource
DataSource --> API
API --> Model
Model --> RepoImpl
RepoImpl --> RepoInterface
RepoInterface --> UseCase
UseCase --> Bloc
Bloc --> UI
